    "id": "w-u45-01",
    "unit": "u45",
    "prompt": "Write the lead paragraphs of a short news item for Mariana's paper. Her source says Altamira paid the suspended councillor, but nothing is confirmed. Report it carefully so the paper does not state it as fact: use the conditional for what is only alleged, and say clearly who says it and what is still unconfirmed.",
