    "prompt": "Write the short note that Altamira's press office sends to the newspapers. It says that the company will have finished the hotel next door before the heritage decision arrives. Give the date, use the future perfect at least once, and stay formal: the press office writes in a calm institutional tone and does not mention the café by name.",
